## 7. Multi-Tenant Database Schema Roadmap

To enable this, we must transition from a single-tenant schema to a multi-tenant one.

### New Core Tables

**1. `organizations`**
Represents a Business (Tenant).
```sql
id (UUID)
name (Text)
tier (Enum: starter, growth, pro, enterprise)
status (Enum: active, suspended, past_due)
subscription_renewal_date (Date)
current_month_balance (Decimal) -- Accumulates usage fees
trial_ends_at (Timestamp)
```

**2. `global_customer_stats`**
Aggregated stats for reputation.
```sql
phone_number (Text) PRIMARY KEY
total_orders (Int)
total_delivered (Int)
total_returned (Int)
last_order_at (Timestamp)
reputation_score (Int) -- 0-100
```
